{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 24 från S, V, C, MP.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 24 by S, V, C, MP.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Comorbidity", "dok_titel": "Organisation of Health and Healthcare", "forslag_text": "Parliament rejects the motions\n\n2023/24:2493 by Christofer Bergenblock et al. (C) amendment 46 and\n\n2023/24:2617 by Fredrik Lundh Sammeli et al. (S) amendment 17.", "notis": "Parliament rejected approximately 100 proposals in motions concerning the organisation and governance of health and healthcare, choice of provider, accessible and equitable healthcare, and mental health from the 2023 general motion period. The motions concerned, for example, the organisation and governance of health and healthcare, choice of provider, accessible and equitable healthcare, and mental health.\nParliament refers, among other things, to work already being undertaken in the areas that the motions address.", "alternatives": ["Parliament rejects the motions\n\n2023/24:2493 by Christofer Bergenblock et al. (C) amendment 46 and\n\n2023/24:2617 by Fredrik Lundh Sammeli et al. (S) amendment 17.", "Reservation 24"]}, "votering_id": "F321E450-82EB-44E6-B289-6C07CFE6C727", "rm": "2023/24", "beteckning": "SoU14", "punkt": 12, "dok_id": "HB01SoU14", "datum": "2024-06-18", "utskott": "SoU", "rubrik": "Samsjuklighet", "dok_titel": "Hälso- och sjukvårdens organisation", "sammanfattning": "Socialutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej till de cirka 100 förslag i motioner om hälso- och sjukvårdens organisation från den allmänna motionstiden 2023. Motionerna handlar 